WEBVTT

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.976
that's the way we spell rowdie.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.393
Rowdie, rowdie, let's get rowdie."

00:01:05.417 --> 00:01:06.417
(Laughter)

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.976
Yeah.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.048
So I couldn't figure out
for the life of me

00:01:11.072 --> 00:01:12.976
why we were supposed to be so rowdy,

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.976
or why we had to spell
this word incorrectly.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:21.976
(Laughter)

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.191
But I recited a cheer. I recited
a cheer along with everybody else.

00:01:25.215 --> 00:01:26.976
I did my best.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:31.079
And I just waited for the time
that I could go off and read my books.